<section class="gifts" id="gifts">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title center" style="color:#fff;">买就送，赠品价值超百元！</h2>
    <p class="section-desc center" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);">限时活动，下单即享多重赠品</p>
    
    <div class="gift-grid">
      <!-- 起泡网（每盒） -->
      <div class="gift-card animate-on-scroll">
        <div class="gift-img">
          <img src="{{ 'slide10_gift_bubble_net.png' | asset_url }}" alt="起泡网" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <h3 class="gift-name">起泡网 <span class="gift-condition">（每盒）</span></h3>
        <p class="gift-desc">轻松打出绵密泡沫，深层清洁毛孔，让每一次洁面都成为享受。</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 沥水皂盒（购买两盒赠送） -->
      <div class="gift-card animate-on-scroll">
        <div class="gift-img">
          <img src="{{ 'slide10_gift_drain_box.png' | asset_url }}" alt="沥水皂盒" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <h3 class="gift-name">沥水皂盒 <span class="gift-condition">（购买两盒赠送）</span></h3>
        <p class="gift-desc">双层镂空沥水设计，有效保持皂体干燥清爽，延长手工皂使用寿命。</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 气垫按摩梳（购买三盒赠送价值） -->
      <div class="gift-card animate-on-scroll">
        <div class="gift-img">
          <img src="{{ 'slide10_gift_air_cushion_comb.png' | asset_url }}" alt="气垫按摩梳" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <h3 class="gift-name">气垫按摩梳 <span class="gift-condition">（购买三盒赠送价值）</span></h3>
        <p class="gift-desc">高弹性气囊梳齿，温柔贴合头皮，有效缓解疲劳，促进头部血液循环。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Gifts",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Gifts" }]
}
{% endschema %}
